If all funds are stolen from one of the derivative protocols then unstake function will always revert [here](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-03-asymmetry/blob/main/contracts/SafEth/SafEth.sol#L118). All funds will get frozen in derivatives because unstake() function is the only way to withdraw funds.

