# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Detailed description of the impact of this finding.
Since staking is not restricted to EOA only, if the staking is done from a Smart contract without fallback and receive function, then unstaking will fail when the SafEth will try to send ether to the staking contract.

This impact may be limited to that contract only for unstaking, but could mess up the computations in the contract and could break the contract business logic of how the withdrawal amount is computed.

